{"turn_id": "d15-t1", "session_id": "d15", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "nmt_model", "text": "为了训练神经机器翻译模型，作者使用了 OpenNMT 的 TensorFlow 实现，并采用基于注意力的 Transformer 架构。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "nmt_vs_smt_bleu", "text": "对于 en–ta 和 en–hi 两个语言对，NMT 模型的 BLEU 分数均高于 SMT 模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "smt_system", "text": "作为对比，基于短语的 SMT 系统使用 Moses 训练。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "sentence_extraction_model", "text": "为了从可比的多语言文章中生成平行句子，作者使用了端到端的孪生双向循环神经网络。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}, {"key": "extraction_encoder", "text": "平行句对提取使用孪生 BiRNN 编码器，并以 GRU 作为激活函数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d15-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d15-t2", "session_id": "d15", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "nmt_implementation", "text": "用于训练神经机器翻译模型时，作者使用了 OpenNMT 的 TensorFlow 实现，并采用基于注意力的 Transformer 架构。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "nmt_vs_smt_bleu", "text": "对于 en–ta 和 en–hi 两种语言对，NMT 模型的 BLEU 分数均高于 SMT 模型（见论文表 TABREF23）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "siamese_birnn_extractor", "text": "论文使用端到端的 Siamese 双向循环神经网络，从 Wikipedia 的可比多语种文章中生成平行句对。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}, {"key": "siamese_gru", "text": "该平行句对抽取方法仅需一个平行语料库，使用 Siamese BiRNN 编码器并以 GRU 作为激活函数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "no_feature_engineering", "text": "作者称其深度神经网络模型无需特征工程，也无需预先存在的翻译系统。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-713c262decd20b8f527dcc24"}]}, {"key": "end_to_end_bootstrap", "text": "用于抽取平行句子的神经模型仅使用少量平行句对作为 bootstrap 集进行端到端学习。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-2de814ddcd37609de37a6670"}]}, {"key": "nmt_training_data", "text": "在训练机器翻译系统时，作者使用通过贪心解码抽取的高精度句子，并按翻译概率对句对进行排序。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-0377bffbf88cf9ead25b03ff"}]}, {"key": "bleu_gains", "text": "使用通过该神经架构从可比语料中抽取的平行句对，en–ta 和 en–hi 的 BLEU 分数分别提升了 11.03% 和 14.7%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1ef4f6dc83e93c39e90f82dc"}]}, {"key": "harvested_data_effect", "text": "与仅使用为这些语言对收集的有限双语语料训练相比，使用收集的数据集提升了 en–hi 和 en–ta 上 NMT 与基于短语的 SMT 系统的 BLEU 分数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1806.09652", "chunk_id": "c-1dd6dc3c2f7d9eb29dc26d9f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d15-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
